00:16:34,736 --> 00:16:40,736
Ginny & Georgia is an American comedy-drama
television series created by Sarah Lampert.

10
00:18:25,263 --> 00:18:31,263
It premiered on Netflix on February 24, 2021, and follows the life of thirty‑one‑year‑old Georgia Miller (portrayed by Brianne Howey) and her teenage
children, Ginny (Antonia Gentry) and Austin (Diesel La Torraca), as they relocate to the fictional town of Wellsbury, Massachusetts.

11
00:20:15,789 --> 00:20:21,789
The show blends elements of teen drama, family
dynamics, mystery, and darker themes.

12
00:22:06,315 --> 00:22:12,315
Upon its debut, Ginny & Georgia drew comparisons to Gilmore Girls for its quick-witted mother-daughter
dynamic but carved its own path with a blend of heartfelt family scenes and dramatic turns.

13
00:23:56,842 --> 00:24:02,842
In April 2021, the series was renewed for a second
season, which premiered on January 5, 2023.

14
00:25:47,368 --> 00:25:53,368
In May 2023, the series was renewed for a third and fourth season.

15
00:27:37,894 --> 00:27:43,894
The third season premiered on June 5, 2025.

16
00:29:28,421 --> 00:29:34,421
There were 52 million subscribers who watched the first season of
the series for the first 28 days after its release.

17
00:31:18,947 --> 00:31:24,947
It has also prompted widespread discussion on themes like identity,
mental health, family secrets, and moral ambiguity.

18
00:33:09,473 --> 00:33:15,473
The casting drew attention after season 3, with media noting
several teen actors were older than their characters.
